      "description_html": "<p><strong>Kisan Udyog is actively hiring for the role of Web Designer Intern!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Organization:</strong></p>\n<p>Kisan Udyog is a dynamic organization dedicated to empowering the agricultural sector through innovative solutions and community development. We are committed to fostering growth and sustainability within the farming community, leveraging technology and strategic initiatives to improve livelihoods. Our work environment is collaborative and purpose-driven, where every team member contributes to our overarching mission of strengthening the agricultural landscape.</p>\n<p><strong>Roles and Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design user-friendly and visually appealing websites that align with Kisan Udyog's brand identity.</li>\n<li>Develop wireframes, mockups, and prototypes to effectively communicate design ideas.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with development teams to ensure the technical feasibility of UI/UX designs.</li>\n<li>Create and maintain a consistent look and feel across all digital platforms.</li>\n<li>Optimize web pages for maximum speed and scalability.</li>\n<li>Ensure all designs are responsive and function seamlessly across various devices and screen sizes.</li>\n<li>Conduct user research and usability testing to gather feedback and iterate on designs.</li>\n<li>Stay updated with the latest web design trends, tools, and technologies.</li>\n<li>Contribute to the overall digital strategy and user experience of Kisan Udyog's online presence.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Design, Computer Science, or a related field.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated understanding of web design principles and best practices.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in design software such as Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, XD) or Figma.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript is a plus.</li>\n<li>Strong portfolio showcasing web design projects.</li>\n<li>Excellent communication and collaboration skills.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills and Qualifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidates should possess a keen eye for visual aesthetics and a strong understanding of user interface (UI) and user experience (UX) design principles.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in industry-standard design tools and a portfolio demonstrating creative problem-solving through design.</li>\n<li>Ability to translate project requirements into intuitive and engaging web designs, with a focus on creating accessible and responsive digital experiences.</li>\n</ul>",
